DESCRIPTION:The Department of Psychiatry's annual Research Forum\, known 
 informally as the Extravaganza\, is a Grand Rounds poster session in whi
 ch department faculty\, residents\, fellows and students present psychia
 tric research for a competitive poster award. The 17th annual edition is
  scheduled for October 7\, 2026\, with abstract submissions opening Sept
 ember 2\, 2026.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-09-02\nAbs
 tract submission deadline: 2026-09-30\n\nhttps://www.psych.uic.edu/extra
 vaganza
LOCATION:Chicago\, Illinois\, COMRB Moss Auditorium\, 909 S. Wolcott Ave\
 , Chicago\, IL
URL:https://www.psych.uic.edu/extravaganza
